  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre Razor Soft is a comfort-oriented co-polyester monofilament designed to deliver the precision of high-modulus polyester with significantly improved comfort through polyurethane additives. It is available in 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges, allowing players to choose between greater spin and elasticity, balanced all-around performance, or increased durability and control.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre Razor Soft 是一款以舒适性为核心设计的共聚酯单丝球线，采用高模量 Co-Polyester 提供精准控制，并加入 PU 聚氨酯添加剂，以改善传统聚酯线偏硬的击球手感。提供1.20、1.25及1.30毫米三种线径选择：1.20更偏旋转与弹性，1.25最均衡，1.30则更偏耐久、控制及较低出球角度。"
  },

